{"page":326,"verses":[{"verse_key":"21:45","surah":21,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ إِنَّمَآ أُنذِرُكُم بِٱلْوَحْىِ ۚ وَلَا يَسْمَعُ ٱلصُّمُّ ٱلدُّعَآءَ إِذَا مَا يُنذَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘I warn you only through the Revelation.’ The deaf will not hear the warning call,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"21:45"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنَّمَآ","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"21:45"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أُنذِرُكُم","en_gloss":"I warn you","transliteration":"undhirukum","verse_key":"21:45"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱلْوَحْىِ ۚ","en_gloss":"by the revelation","transliteration":"bil-waḥyi","verse_key":"21:45"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"But not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"21:45"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَسْمَعُ","en_gloss":"hear","transliteration":"yasmaʿu","verse_key":"21:45"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلصُّمُّ","en_gloss":"the deaf","transliteration":"l-ṣumu","verse_key":"21:45"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلدُّعَآءَ","en_gloss":"the call","transliteration":"l-duʿāa","verse_key":"21:45"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"21:45"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"21:45"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُنذَرُونَ","en_gloss":"they are warned","transliteration":"yundharūna","verse_key":"21:45"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٤٥","en_gloss":"(45)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:45"}]},{"verse_key":"21:46","surah":21,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَئِن مَّسَّتْهُمْ نَفْحَةٌ مِّنْ عَذَابِ رَبِّكَ لَيَقُولُنَّ يَـٰوَيْلَنَآ إِنَّا كُنَّا ظَـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"yet if a mere breath of your Lord’s punishment touches them, they will be sure to cry, ‘Woe to us! We were wrong!’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَئِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wala-in","verse_key":"21:46"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَّسَّتْهُمْ","en_gloss":"touches them","transliteration":"massathum","verse_key":"21:46"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَفْحَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a whiff","translit